  "releaseNotes": "New History tab on the Background Jobs dashboard: a cross-job browser over the retention-capped run history with filters for job, status, trigger, date range, and free-text search (matches run errors, run messages, and log lines), plus paginated results and inline log drill-down per run. Each job card now has a View in history link that opens the History tab pre-filtered by that job. Adds an IX_JobsJobsJobsBackgroundJobRun_StartedAt index (v6 migration) to keep the cross-job ordered query fast.",
